,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":[],"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":true,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/subjects/braincase.webp"}},"flags":{"sf2e":{"linkToActorSize":true,"autoscale":false}},"randomImg":false,"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null},"items":[{"type":"action","name":"Cranium Shell","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>The first time the braincase would be reduced to 0 HP, they are reduced to 1 HP instead as the shell shatters, exposing their brain. The shell remains broken until the braincase is restored to full HP. While their brain is exposed, any damage the braincase takes kills them regardless of their current HP.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","deathNote":true},"effects":[],"_id":"77LAxj7yzceKWjtv","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Don't You Dare!","system":{"actionType":{"value":"reaction"},"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The braincase is the target of a ranged attack</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The braincase attempts to @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.actions.Item.2u915NdUyQan6uKF]{Demoralize} the attacking creature. This ignores any temporary immunity the creature has to Demoralize attempts from the braincase and doesn't make them temporarily immune to Demoralize.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"eDVEy8p0qkoEuz02","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Obstructing Palm","system":{"actionType":{"value":"reaction"},"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature within 20 feet moves closer to the braincase</p><p><strong>Requirements</strong> The braincase is in Six Palms Stance</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The braincase makes a force palm Strike against the creature. If the Strike critically hits, the creature is also knocked @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{Prone}, interrupting the movement. This Strike neither applies nor counts toward the braincase's multiple attack penalty.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"0ZDbciP2b1fotezb","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"